<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<catalogue xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema" id="opr36-ej-catalogue" name="Elven Jesters - Completed" revision="3" battleScribeVersion="2.03" library="false" gameSystemId="b174-c09d-3660-f001" gameSystemRevision="5"><sharedRules><rule id="opr36-ej-00001" name="Rapid Blink" hidden="false"><description>When this unit is activated, you may move all models with this rule in it by up to D3&quot;.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-00002" name="Ambush Re-Deployment" hidden="false"><description>Once per game, when a unit where all models have this rule ends its activation, you may immediately remove it from the table (dropping any objectives it might hold within 1&quot;), and deploy it as if it had Ambush at the beginning of the next round.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-00003" name="Ambushing Piercing Shot" hidden="false"><description>Counts as having Ambush, and its weapons get AP(+1) when shooting on the round in which it deploys via this rule.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-00004" name="Destructive" hidden="false"><description>When attacking units with more than half of their total size or Tough value (for single-model units), those hits get AP(+1).</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-00005" name="Enhanced Nimble" hidden="false"><description>If this model has Nimble, it may move by up to 2D3&quot; from Nimble (instead of only D3&quot;).</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-00006" name="Enhanced Rapid Blink" hidden="false"><description>If this model has Rapid Blink, it may move by up to 2D3&quot; from Rapid Blink (instead of only D3&quot;).</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-00007" name="Infiltrate" hidden="false"><description>Counts as having Ambush, but may be deployed anywhere over 3&quot; away from enemy unit.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-00008" name="Infiltrating Precision Strike" hidden="false"><description>Counts as having Infiltrate, and gets +1 to hit rolls in melee on the round in which it deploys via this rule.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-00009" name="Nimble" hidden="false"><description>When this unit is activated, you may move all models with this rule in it by up to D3&quot;.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-0000a" name="Repel Ambushers" hidden="false"><description>Enemy units using Ambush must be set up over 12&quot; away from this model's unit.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-0000b" name="Shielded" hidden="false"><description>Units where most models have this rule get +1 to Defense rolls against hits that are not from spells.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-0000c" name="Slayer" hidden="false"><description>When using Hold actions and shooting, or when charging, this model's weapons get AP(+2) if most models in the target have Tough(3) or higher.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-0000d" name="Slayer Mark" hidden="false"><description>Once per activation, before attacking, pick one enemy unit within 18&quot; in line of sight, which friendly units gets Slayer against once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-0000e" name="Takedown Shot" hidden="false"><description>Once per game, when this model shoots, it may make X extra attacks against the target at Quality 2+ with AP(2), Deadly(3), and Takedown.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-0000f" name="Takedown Strike" hidden="false"><description>Once per game, when it's this model's turn to strike in melee, it may make X attacks at Quality 2+ with AP(2), Deadly(3), and Takedown.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-0000g" name="Teleport" hidden="false"><description>Once per activation, before attacking, you may place this model anywhere fully within 3&quot; of its position when using Advance/Charge actions, or fully within 6&quot; of its position when using Rush actions.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-0000h" name="Unpredictable" hidden="false"><description>When attacking, roll one die and apply one effect to all models with this rule: on a 1-3 they get AP(+1) on their weapons, and on a 4-6 they get +1 to hit rolls instead.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-0000i" name="Unpredictable Fighter" hidden="false"><description>When in melee, roll one die and apply one effect to all models with this rule: on a 1-3 they get AP(+1) on their weapons, and on a 4-6 they get +1 to hit rolls instead.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-0000j" name="Enhanced Rapid Blink Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Enhanced Rapid Blink.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-0000k" name="Increased Shooting Range Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get +6&quot; range on its weapons when shooting.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-0000l" name="Shielded Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Shielded.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-0000m" name="Teleport Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Teleport.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-0000n" name="Unpredictable Fighter Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Unpredictable Fighter.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-0000o" name="Asphyxiating Fog (1)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one friendly unit within 12&quot;, which gets Counter in Melee once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-0000p" name="Blades of Discord (1)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy unit within 6&quot;, which takes 1 hit with AP(2) and Deadly(3).</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-0000q" name="Veil of Madness (2)" hidden="false"><description>Pick up to two enemy units within 18&quot; in line of sight, which friendly units gets Slayer against once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-0000r" name="Light Fragments (2)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy unit within 12&quot; in line of sight, which takes 6 hits with Destructive.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-0000s" name="Shadow Dance (3)" hidden="false"><description>Pick up to three friendly units within 18&quot;, which get Enhanced Rapid Blink once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-0000t" name="Fatal Sorrow (3)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy unit within 24&quot; in line of sight, which takes 6 hits.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-0001h" name="Anti-Cover" hidden="false"><description>When attacking with this weapon, ignore the target's cover protection.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-ej-001y9" name="Armor(2)" hidden="false"><description>While the item granting this rule is equipped, this model uses Defense 2+.</description></rule><rule id="ej36-r2-00001" name="Armor(4)" hidden="false"><description>While the item granting this rule is equipped, this model uses Defense 4+.</description></rule></sharedRules><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="opr-spellcat-ej-entry" name="Spell Catalogue" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="ej36-r2-002y8" name="Spell Catalogue" targetId="opr-spell-catalogue-category" primary="true" hidden="false"/></categoryLinks><infoLinks><infoLink id="ej36-r2-002y9" name="Asphyxiating Fog (1)" targetId="opr36-ej-0000o" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="ej36-r2-002ya" name="Blades of Discord (1)" targetId="opr36-ej-0000p" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="ej36-r2-002yb" name="Veil of Madness (2)" targetId="opr36-ej-0000q" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="ej36-r2-002yc" name="Light Fragments (2)" targetId="opr36-ej-0000r" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="ej36-r2-002yd" name="Shadow Dance (3)" targetId="opr36-ej-0000s" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="ej36-r2-002ye" name="Fatal Sorrow (3)" targetId="opr36-ej-0000t" type="rule" hidden="false"/></infoLinks><constraints><constraint id="ej36-r2-002yf" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true"/><constraint id="ej36-r2-002yg" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true"/></constraints></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="ej36-r2-00046" name="Master Jester" type="unit" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="ej36-r2-00040" name="Heroes" targetId="b174-c09d-3660-f041" primary="true" hidden="false"/></categoryLinks><profiles><profile id="ej36-r2-00041" name="Master Jester" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f010" typeName="Unit" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic name="Quality" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f011">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Defense" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f012">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f013">Furious, Hero, Rapid Blink, Stealth, Tough(3)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><infoLinks><infoLink id="ej36-r2-00042" name="Furious" targetId="opr-core-furious" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="ej36-r2-00043" name="Hero" targetId="opr-core-hero" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="ej36-r2-00044" name="Rapid Blink" targetId="opr36-ej-00001" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="ej36-r2-00045" name="Stealth" targetId="opr-core-stealth" type="rule" hidden="false"/></infoLinks><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="ej36-r2-0003z" name="Model 1" type="model" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint id="ej36-r2-0003x" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="ej36-r2-0003y" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/></constraints><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="ej36-r2-0002q" name="Replace Hand Weapon and Jester Buckler" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" defaultSelectionEntryId="ej36-r2-0002l"><constraints><constraint id="ej36-r2-0002r" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="ej36-r2-0002s" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent"